en:
''We got to move! We got to move out!''
Enhanced Battlefield Combat Pants specially customized for COPSC with a built-in Stance Tracking-Correction system
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% SMALL-ARMS | +5% MELEE | +25% DODGE^reset;
^#ffffa7;PCV Charged [FULL SET x3 REQUIRED]- Require POWER, +45% THERMAL, MELEE and HEAVY-ARMS | +25% GDI Weapon Proficiency | Refund a Firehawk AGM Strike when reload, Cooldown 90s^reset;

ko:
''움직여야 해! 이동한다!''
내장 자세 추적-보정 시스템이 있는 콥스크 특주 강화 전장 전투 바지
^#DBC5A6;방어력: 소화기 +10% | 근접 +5% | 회피 +25%^reset;
